The receive-goal benchmark of benchmarks/receive-goal, on few messages, so
that it keeps building and every message is taken once: one mailbox, two,
and messages that no case selects in front.

RUN: merkc -O2 -freceive-goal -fprocess-declarations -Wno-unselected-message %S/../../benchmarks/receive-goal/receive-goal.m -o %t
RUN: %t plain 1000 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PLAIN
RUN: %t two 1000 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TWO
RUN: %t skip 100 1000 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SKIP
PLAIN: plain {{ *}}1000 messages, sum 500500, {{.*}} ns a message
TWO: two {{ *}}1000 messages, sum 500500, {{.*}} ns a message
SKIP: skip 100 {{ *}}1000 messages, sum 500500, {{.*}} ns a message
